+# Claude-like readability for Kilo (chat, docs, PRs — not source code)
+
+## Goal
+
+Make **human-facing writing** in Kilo as easy to skim as Claude in Brave: bigger prose, real paragraph rhythm, bold takeaways, nested structure. Leave **source code and diffs correctness-first**. Do not keep patching Kilo internals ad hoc.
+
+## Why Claude feels better (two layers)
+
+Claude wins because of **writing**, then **type**. Not because of 2,000 CSS variables.
+
+| Layer | What Claude does | What Kilo does today |
+|---|---|---|
